# Python

- Python 3.11+. Prefer modern generics (`list[T]`, `X | None`); avoid `typing.List` / `Optional` aliases.
- Imports at module top unless circular. Keep package `__init__.py` minimal.
- Prefer project venv via `uv` / `.venv`; never install into system Python.
- pytest-first; strict mypy/pyright deferred. No notebooks as source of truth.
- Prefer Ruff if configured; fix lint in files you touch.
